b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/events_flooring.png","image_width":650,"title":"Drainage Slots for Preserving Nature","text":"<p>Strategically placed drainage slots ensure efficient water drainage. When used over grass, they preserve the natural ground, offering an eco-friendly option for outdoor events.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/drainageeventflooring.png","image_width":650,"title":"Color Options to Suit Your Style","text":"<p>Available in both grey and brown, the CM Viper Deck Hexa Tile allows you to customize your flooring to match the aesthetics of your event or military setup seamlessly.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-3":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/viperdeckhexaeventflooring.png","image_width":650,"title":"Impressive Load-Bearing Capacity","text":"<p>Built for diverse applications, these hexagonal tiles offer an impressive load-bearing capacity of 285psi or 18t\/ft2 on stable ground, ensuring strength and security for event setups and military tents on the CM Viper Deck Hexa Tile.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-1","template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-2","template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-3"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"advanced_content_TpqpkH":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"liquid_pAEDX7":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<b>SPECIFICATIONS<\/b>\n<table width=\"50%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 200px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 200px;\"><strong> Outer width<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 200px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 200px;\">18 ⅛\"<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 200px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 200px;\"><strong> Inner width<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 200px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 200px;\">15 ¾\"<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 200px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 200px;\"><strong> Height<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 200px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 200px;\">1 ⅝\"<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 200px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 200px;\"><strong> Weight per slab<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\">3.75 lbs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\"><strong> Coverage per slab <\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\">1.5 ft²<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\"><strong> Slabs per pallet<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\">354<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\"><strong>Coverage per pallet<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\">531 ft²<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\"><strong>Material<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\">100% recycled plastic<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\"><strong>Connection<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\">Interlocking hooks<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\"><strong>Color<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 538px;\" data-mce-style=\"width: 538px;\">Gray or Brown<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n\n<b>DISCLAIMER: Color Variation in Recycled Tiles<\/b><br>\n<i>Please note that our grey recycled tiles may initially exhibit a greenish tint due to the materials used in their manufacture. This is a normal characteristic of the recycling process. As the tiles are exposed to natural elements such as sunlight and rain, they will gradually transition to their true grey color. This enhancement of the tiles' appearance over time reflects the unique quality and sustainability of our eco-friendly products. Choose an environmentally responsible option.<\/i>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["liquid_pAEDX7"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}},"text-and-image2":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/eventflooring.png","image_width":700,"subtitle":"","title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text-and-image":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_2_image.value }}","image_width":620,"subtitle":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_2_sub_heading.value }}","title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_2_heading.value }}","text":"<p>{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_2_description | metafield_tag }}<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":true}},"0d72f363-ade5-4fe4-ba0e-abdaacb810a8":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"template--14498159001729__0d72f363-ade5-4fe4-ba0e-abdaacb810a8-1684936863110cd631-0":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/viper-deck-500-ground-protection-rig-mats-1_540x_64ef4bf8-7e74-4e43-8e11-78d5c4540867.webp","link":"","width":"33%","alignment":"center"}},"template--14498159001729__0d72f363-ade5-4fe4-ba0e-abdaacb810a8-16849368